    "description": "Shortly after the Fall, the refugees from Earth who would evolve into the scum faction struggled for resources under cramped conditions. Partying and letting off steam became an essential element of their survival. To complement this lifestyle, scum genehackers crafted morphs with the endurance to handle ragers with copious amounts of sex and drugs. These models became popular across the Solar System, particularly with \"party tourists\" looking to egocast into a new habitat, go on a week-long bender, and then beam back out.",
